# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the context root's
# .dockerignore. This image's context IS the repo root (it assembles nine
# projects), so it needs its own — the root .dockerignore is written for the
# strad core image and would not exclude the right things here.
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/.git
**/.github
docs/
personal-website/
test/
**/*.md
!servers/bundle/README.md
